[
  {
    "content_id": "10051001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;奉上帝旨意，作基督耶穌使徒的保羅和兄弟提摩太</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;寫信給歌羅西的聖徒，在基督裏有忠心的弟兄。願恩惠、平安從上帝我們的父歸與你們！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我們感謝上帝我們主耶穌基督的父，常常為你們禱告；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;因聽見你們在基督耶穌裏的信心，並向眾聖徒的愛心，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;是為那給你們存在天上的盼望；這盼望就是你們從前在福音真理的道上所聽見的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;這福音傳到你們那裏，也傳到普天之下，並且結果，增長，如同在你們中間，自從你們聽見福音，真知道上帝恩惠的日子一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;正如你們從我們所親愛、一同作僕人的以巴弗所學的。他為我們作了基督忠心的執事，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;也把你們因聖靈所存的愛心告訴了我們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;因此，我們自從聽見的日子，也就為你們不住地禱告祈求，願你們在一切屬靈的智慧悟性上，滿心知道上帝的旨意；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;好叫你們行事為人對得起主，凡事蒙他喜悅，在一切善事上結果子，漸漸地多知道上帝；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;照他榮耀的權能，得以在各樣的力上加力，好叫你們凡事歡歡喜喜地忍耐寬容；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;又感謝父，叫我們能與眾聖徒在光明中同得基業。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他救了我們脫離黑暗的權勢，把我們遷到他愛子的國裏；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我們在愛子裏得蒙救贖，罪過得以赦免。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;愛子是那不能看見之上帝的像，是首生的，在一切被造的以先。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;因為萬有都是靠他造的，無論是天上的，地上的；能看見的，不能看見的；或是有位的，主治的，執政的，掌權的；一概都是藉着他造的，又是為他造的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;他在萬有之先；萬有也靠他而立。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他也是教會全體之首。他是元始，是從死裏首先復生的，使他可以在凡事上居首位。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;因為父喜歡叫一切的豐盛在他裏面居住。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;既然藉着他在十字架上所流的血成就了和平，便藉着他叫萬有－無論是地上的、天上的－都與自己和好了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你們從前與上帝隔絕，因着惡行，心裏與他為敵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;但如今他藉着基督的肉身受死，叫你們與自己和好，都成了聖潔，沒有瑕疵，無可責備，把你們引到自己面前。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;只要你們在所信的道上恆心，根基穩固，堅定不移，不致被引動失去福音的盼望。這福音就是你們所聽過的，也是傳與普天下萬人聽的，我－保羅也作了這福音的執事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;現在我為你們受苦，倒覺歡樂；並且為基督的身體，就是為教會，要在我肉身上補滿基督患難的缺欠。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;我照上帝為你們所賜我的職分作了教會的執事，要把上帝的道理傳得全備，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001026",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;這道理就是歷世歷代所隱藏的奧祕；但如今向他的聖徒顯明了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001027",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;上帝願意叫他們知道，這奧祕在外邦人中有何等豐盛的榮耀，就是基督在你們心裏成了有榮耀的盼望。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001028",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;我們傳揚他，是用諸般的智慧，勸戒各人，教導各人，要把各人在基督裏完完全全地引到上帝面前。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 1:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001029",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;我也為此勞苦，照着他在我裏面運用的大能盡心竭力。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我願意你們曉得，我為你們和老底嘉人，並一切沒有與我親自見面的人，是何等地盡心竭力；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;要叫他們的心得安慰，因愛心互相聯絡，以致豐豐足足在悟性中有充足的信心，使他們真知上帝的奧祕，就是基督；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;所積蓄的一切智慧知識，都在他裏面藏着。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我說這話，免得有人用花言巧語迷惑你們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我身子雖與你們相離，心卻與你們同在，見你們循規蹈矩，信基督的心也堅固，我就歡喜了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你們既然接受了主基督耶穌，就當遵他而行，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;在他裏面生根建造，信心堅固，正如你們所領的教訓，感謝的心也更增長了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你們要謹慎，恐怕有人用他的理學和虛空的妄言，不照着基督，乃照人間的遺傳和世上的小學就把你們擄去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;因為上帝本性一切的豐盛都有形有體地居住在基督裏面，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;你們在他裏面也得了豐盛。他是各樣執政掌權者的元首。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;你們在他裏面也受了不是人手所行的割禮，乃是基督使你們脫去肉體情慾的割禮。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你們既受洗與他一同埋葬，也就在此與他一同復活，都因信那叫他從死裏復活上帝的功用。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你們從前在過犯和未受割禮的肉體中死了，上帝赦免了你們一切過犯，便叫你們與基督一同活過來；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;又塗抹了在律例上所寫、攻擊我們、有礙於我們的字據，把它撤去，釘在十字架上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;既將一切執政的、掌權的擄來，明顯給眾人看，就仗着十字架誇勝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;所以，不拘在飲食上，或節期、月朔、安息日都不可讓人論斷你們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;這些原是後事的影兒；那形體卻是基督。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;不可讓人因着故意謙虛和敬拜天使，就奪去你們的獎賞。這等人拘泥在所見過的，隨着自己的慾心，無故地自高自大，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;不持定元首。全身既然靠着他，筋節得以相助聯絡，就因上帝大得長進。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:20-21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20-21</sup>&nbsp;你們若是與基督同死，脫離了世上的小學，為甚麼仍像在世俗中活着、服從那「不可拿、不可嘗、不可摸」等類的規條呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;這都是照人所吩咐、所教導的。說到這一切，正用的時候就都敗壞了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;這些規條使人徒有智慧之名，用私意崇拜，自表謙卑，苦待己身，其實在克制肉體的情慾上是毫無功效。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;所以，你們若真與基督一同復活，就當求在上面的事；那裏有基督坐在上帝的右邊。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你們要思念上面的事，不要思念地上的事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因為你們已經死了，你們的生命與基督一同藏在上帝裏面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;基督是我們的生命，他顯現的時候，你們也要與他一同顯現在榮耀裏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;所以，要治死你們在地上的肢體，就如淫亂、污穢、邪情、惡慾，和貪婪（貪婪就與拜偶像一樣）。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;因這些事，上帝的忿怒必臨到那悖逆之子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;當你們在這些事中活着的時候，也曾這樣行過。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;但現在你們要棄絕這一切的事，以及惱恨、忿怒、惡毒、毀謗，並口中污穢的言語。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;不要彼此說謊；因你們已經脫去舊人和舊人的行為，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;穿上了新人。這新人在知識上漸漸更新，正如造他主的形像。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;在此並不分希臘人、猶太人，受割禮的、未受割禮的，化外人、西古提人，為奴的、自主的，惟有基督是包括一切，又住在各人之內。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;所以，你們既是上帝的選民，聖潔蒙愛的人，就要存憐憫、恩慈、謙虛、溫柔、忍耐的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;倘若這人與那人有嫌隙，總要彼此包容，彼此饒恕；主怎樣饒恕了你們，你們也要怎樣饒恕人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;在這一切之外，要存着愛心，愛心就是聯絡全德的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;又要叫基督的平安在你們心裏作主；你們也為此蒙召，歸為一體；且要存感謝的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;當用各樣的智慧，把基督的道理豐豐富富地存在心裏，用詩章、頌詞、靈歌，彼此教導，互相勸戒，心被恩感，歌頌上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;無論做甚麼，或說話或行事，都要奉主耶穌的名，藉着他感謝父上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;你們作妻子的，當順服自己的丈夫，這在主裏面是相宜的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;你們作丈夫的，要愛你們的妻子，不可苦待她們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;你們作兒女的，要凡事聽從父母，因為這是主所喜悅的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你們作父親的，不要惹兒女的氣，恐怕他們失了志氣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;你們作僕人的，要凡事聽從你們肉身的主人，不要只在眼前事奉，像是討人喜歡的，總要存心誠實敬畏主。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;無論做甚麼，都要從心裏做，像是給主做的，不是給人做的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;因你們知道從主那裏必得着基業為賞賜；你們所事奉的乃是主基督。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 3:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;那行不義的必受不義的報應；主並不偏待人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你們作主人的，要公公平平地待僕人，因為知道你們也有一位主在天上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你們要恆切禱告，在此警醒感恩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;也要為我們禱告，求上帝給我們開傳道的門，能以講基督的奧祕（我為此被捆鎖），</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;叫我按着所該說的話將這奧祕發明出來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你們要愛惜光陰，用智慧與外人交往。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你們的言語要常常帶着和氣，好像用鹽調和，就可知道該怎樣回答各人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;有我親愛的兄弟推基古要將我一切的事都告訴你們。他是忠心的執事，和我一同作主的僕人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我特意打發他到你們那裏去，好叫你們知道我們的光景，又叫他安慰你們的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我又打發一位親愛忠心的兄弟阿尼西謀同去；他也是你們那裏的人。他們要把這裏一切的事都告訴你們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;與我一同坐監的亞里達古問你們安。巴拿巴的表弟馬可也問你們安。（說到這馬可，你們已經受了吩咐；他若到了你們那裏，你們就接待他。）</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;耶數又稱為猶士都，也問你們安。奉割禮的人中，只有這三個人是為上帝的國與我一同做工的，也是叫我心裏得安慰的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;有你們那裏的人，作基督耶穌僕人的以巴弗問你們安。他在禱告之間，常為你們竭力地祈求，願你們在上帝一切的旨意上得以完全，信心充足，能站立得穩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他為你們和老底嘉並希拉坡里的弟兄多多地勞苦，這是我可以給他作見證的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;所親愛的醫生路加和底馬問你們安。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;請問老底嘉的弟兄和寧法，並她家裏的教會安。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你們念了這書信，便交給老底嘉的教會，叫他們也念；你們也要念從老底嘉來的書信。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;要對亞基布說：「務要謹慎，盡你從主所受的職分。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌羅西書 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我－保羅親筆問你們安。你們要記念我的捆鎖。願恩惠常與你們同在！</p>"
  }
]